  "details": "The custom safety profiles are time consuming to change, especially when you have to change audio, shaders, etc for 6 different user groups. \n\nIt would be great if there were additional safety profiles that you can create and easily swap back and forth. \n\nExample: Say you want to activate animations for all user groups but, disable shaders depending on room capacity and/or instance type. You can then have custom safety profile 1 which is stricter and custom safety profile 2 which is more lenient. Now all you have to do is swap the safety profiles instead on manually turning everything on or off for all user types.",
